{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Hatiwal Dark (fa)",
  "metadata": {
    "hatiwal:purpose": "Search-surface basemap. Deliberately quiet: the LISTINGS are the content and this is the backdrop. Brand gold (#E8B23A) is absent on purpose — it belongs to the price markers drawn on top, and a gold-flecked basemap would make them stop standing out.",
    "hatiwal:labels": "name:fa -> name:nonlatin -> name -> name:latin. Verified against a live tile: name:fa exists, name:ps does NOT (not in planetiler's default language set), so ps falls back to Dari script rather than to a Latin transliteration.",
    "hatiwal:palette": "Colours are the APP's own tokens from hatiwal-mobile/src/hooks/useColors.ts (dark): background, card, muted, border, foreground, mutedForeground, mapWater. The map is the same light/dark as every other screen, not an approximation of it. Brand gold (#E8B23A) stays absent — it belongs to the price markers drawn on top.",
    "hatiwal:zoomcoverage": "Labels exist at EVERY zoom: city/town/region low, suburb/neighbourhood mid, street names from z14. Caught by the render test asserting labels>0 — z15 had none at all before, because place-label matched only city-and-above."
  },
  "sources": {
